import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 513 | Quest Sediment Domain | Methodology of Quest-Domain Simulation Review","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 513 | Quest Sediment Domain | Methodology of Quest-Domain Simulation Review","no":513,"module":3,"tags":["Quest Sediment Domain","Quest-Domain Simulation Review","Methodology","Causal Review","Experience Return"],"related":["84-Archaeological Protocol Overview","87-Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle","89-Time-Paradox Prevention Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0513_模块3-求索域模拟复盘方法论.md","filePath":"en/0513_模块3-求索域模拟复盘方法论.md"}'),n={name:"en/0513_模块3-求索域模拟复盘方法论.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,c,u){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-513-quest-sediment-domain-methodology-of-quest-domain-simulation-review" tabindex="-1">Entry 513 | Quest Sediment Domain | Methodology of Quest-Domain Simulation Review <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-513-quest-sediment-domain-methodology-of-quest-domain-simulation-review" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 513 | Quest Sediment Domain | Methodology of Quest-Domain Simulation Review&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 84, 87, 89</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turn-the-detours-walked-into-myriad-ranks-textbooks" tabindex="-1">Introduction: turn &quot;the detours walked&quot; into Myriad Ranks&#39; textbooks <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turn-the-detours-walked-into-myriad-ranks-textbooks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: turn &quot;the detours walked&quot; into Myriad Ranks&#39; textbooks&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Quest Sediment Domain serves not only individual trials; it also has a grander function — <strong>Quest-Domain Simulation Review</strong>. The so-called simulation review is: re-enact in a controlled environment failures, mistakes, disasters that have historically happened (including other planes, other civilizations, other timelines), letting contemporary cultivators experience as &quot;participants,&quot; extracting lessons from it. This is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s core engineering of &quot;thoroughly eradicating civilizational regression and historical reversal.&quot; Six top-level axioms run through this methodology: anti-predation axiom requires review not schadenfreude; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires lessons face Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom requires turning individual lessons into collective textbooks; causal self-discipline axiom requires review strictly isolated, not disturbing real history; law-first axiom requires review process stable and recalculable. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article decomposes the Quest-Domain simulation review&#39;s standard methodology.</p><h2 id="i-five-step-review-process" tabindex="-1">I. Five-Step Review Process <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-step-review-process" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five-Step Review Process&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Step</th><th>Name</th><th>Key Action</th><th>Time Share</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Source Purification</td><td>Strip emotional color and partisan bias from historical records; keep only factual skeleton</td><td>10%</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Environment Reconstruction</td><td>High-fidelity reconstruct the natural, social, psychological environment of the time in isolated space</td><td>20%</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Participant Immersion</td><td>Let trainees enter as the person concerned, facing the same choices</td><td>50%</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Difference Recording</td><td>Record all differences between trainee and historical real choice</td><td>10%</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Lesson Distillation</td><td>Write differences and results as &quot;lesson cards,&quot; file into Alaya Network</td><td>10%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Five steps walked, a segment of history turns from &quot;a story of the past&quot; into &quot;a textbook Myriad Ranks can learn from.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-review-must-be-done-in-the-quest-domain-not-the-acceleration-domain" tabindex="-1">II. Why Review Must Be Done in the Quest Domain, Not the Acceleration Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-review-must-be-done-in-the-quest-domain-not-the-acceleration-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why Review Must Be Done in the Quest Domain, Not the Acceleration Domain&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Review needs slow. Three reasons:</p><ul><li><strong>Emotional immersion needs time</strong>: only at near-real flow rate can trainees truly feel the pressure, fear, temptation of the time; fast-forward will hollow out these feelings;</li><li><strong>Causal density needs unfolding</strong>: historical events&#39; causal chains are long; fast-forward will compress intermediate links, making lessons shallow;</li><li><strong>Risk isolation needs calm</strong>: review is reprocessing of history; must have a slow, unemotional observer present, ensuring historical mistakes are not repeated.</li></ul><p>This is why Quest-Domain simulation review is written into dual-track design — it is not the Acceleration Domain&#39;s byproduct, but an independent procedure that must be done slowly.</p><h2 id="iii-ethical-boundaries-of-review" tabindex="-1">III. Ethical Boundaries of Review <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-ethical-boundaries-of-review" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Ethical Boundaries of Review&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Simulation review is not taking historical suffering as entertainment. It has strict ethical boundaries:</p><ul><li>Reviews involving real deceased must pass their civilization&#39;s ethics review;</li><li>Trainees may not in review impose new harmful dramatization on &quot;historical figures&quot;;</li><li>Review conclusions may not be used to provide legitimacy for invasion, predation, revenge;</li><li>All review records open to Myriad Ranks, but original details desensitized as needed.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-historical-nihilism" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With &quot;Historical Nihilism&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-historical-nihilism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With &quot;Historical Nihilism&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory-school systems&#39; attitude toward history is usually two kinds: either treat history as success-study material (&quot;how the protagonist endured back then&quot;), or treat history as nonexistent (&quot;anyway my cheat is the biggest&quot;). Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Quest-Domain simulation review is the opposite: treat history as teacher, failures as textbooks, detours as signposts. This is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s methodological promise of &quot;thoroughly eradicating civilizational regression.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-connection-between-review-and-reality-teaching" tabindex="-1">V. Connection Between Review and Reality Teaching <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-connection-between-review-and-reality-teaching" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Connection Between Review and Reality Teaching&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Lesson cards produced by Quest-Domain simulation review are not left to gather dust in a warehouse. They are systematically incorporated into the symbiotic education system (Document 37): Sense-Origin students learn basic cases; Transform-Origin students learn complex cases; Boundary-Breaking students personally participate in constructing new cases. A lesson learned from review is far more effective than personally making a mistake in reality. This education method of &quot;first learn others&#39; mistakes, then walk one&#39;s own road&quot; is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s implementation at the civilizational inheritance layer — Myriad Ranks need not reinvent lessons from their own blood and tears every generation.</p><h3 id="review-conclusion-update-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Review-Conclusion Update Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#review-conclusion-update-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Review-Conclusion Update Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h3><p>History does not end, and review conclusions are not final. Every epoch, the Anchor Council re-examines the classic case library: conclusions then thought &quot;correct,&quot; under new laws and new cognition, do they still hold? For example, an early case judged &quot;centralized power&quot; as necessarily wrong; later cross-plane comparison found centralized power under specific ecologies is actually more stable. This self-renewal keeps the review library from becoming dogma, but living knowledge. The law-first axiom here is embodied: review conclusions themselves are also bound by law, may be corrected by new evidence.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: using one review to avoid Myriad Ranks repeating old mistakes is the most efficient energy saving</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: review explicitly shows predatory civilizations&#39; inevitable end, letting trainees understand its absurdity from inside</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s protagonist rarely reviews his own mistakes; supporting roles&#39; failures only set off the protagonist; Heng Yuan Zhou writes review into institutions</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: review case library covers Myriad Ranks&#39; five gene-lineages&#39; failure lessons, not limited to human race</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: five-step process, ethical boundaries, lesson-card format all public; any plane can organize its own review</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>History does not simply repeat, but it rhymes. Quest-Domain simulation review tells Myriad Ranks about the &quot;rhyming&quot; in advance, so every generation need not reinvent lessons from their own blood and tears. This is slow&#39;s greatest contribution to civilization — it does not directly produce power, but it lets power no longer be wasted on mistakes already made.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./84-考古协议总纲.html">84-Archaeological Protocol Overview</a> · <a href="./87-仅回传知识原则.html">87-Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle</a> · <a href="./89-时间悖论防控机制.html">89-Time-Paradox Prevention Mechanism</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=i(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
